estimated_minutes: 240
acceptance_criteria: "Patch external Axios to a cooldown-eligible supported release and eliminate affected CJS/ESM bundled copies with reproducible integrity and source-map evidence.; Preserve CodSpeed instrumentation, platform compatibility, benchmark coverage and package contracts; retain genuine pre-fix vulnerability controls.; Enforce development dependency vulnerability admission in mandatory CI, nightly, release and local gates; seeded vulnerable artifacts must fail without changing coverage or quality thresholds.; Verify full and production audits, dev-inclusive Trivy, real Node/Bun tooling and merged-main Scorecard retirement; document evidence tiers without suppressing or dismissing an unresolved report."
parent: pm-qwoy
risk: high
confidence: high
resolution: "Removed vulnerable embedded CJS/ESM clients through an exact-version patch, preserved maps/native payloads and interceptor isolation, enforced regular-file inventory against shadows, and accepted bounded configuration comments while detecting continued or literal credentials across all JavaScript line terminators."
expected_result: "Audited tooling retains runtime compatibility, only reviewed artifacts are admitted, benign complete expressions remain usable, and vulnerable or redirected dependencies and genuine credentials fail mandatory local, CI, nightly and release controls."
actual_result: "Canonical test-local-murk9e8z-r4gw2y passes 9628 tests with 100/100/100/100; measured test-local-murkhsbe-xcywcf retains twelve values bound to SHA-256 f586fac52502b298f1401e44e92e9330eda233cdcd7bd05fd3f88e6de87d551c. Parity test-local-murkcofa-t7qfi3 passes 42 cases. Static/typecheck, packed npm/npx/bunx SDK consumers, 89-command dogfood, real HTTP/inventory controls and actual Trivy 0.70.0 dev-only vulnerable/corrected fixtures pass. Native review, Windows, merged-main Scorecard retirement and the next eligible publication remain distinct delivery boundaries under pm-7zs0."
